{"unit_id":"1052326311__dsh-ask-first#card-zh","repo":"1052326311/dsh-ask-first","commit":"7bcb928754969c1e107425b33c1e98480d686dbd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ask-first 是 DSH 的需求发现插件，通过 system prompt 引导 Agent 先检查可获得的信息，再围绕会改变方案的目标、范围和约束进行自适应访谈。它支持 adaptive、thorough 和 on-demand 三种模式，并限制每轮问题数量；发现完成后，可用 DSH 原生提问界面展示需求摘要，让用户确认、修改或继续访谈。Plan Mode 下由原生计划审批完成最终确认。适合在开发或产品任务开始前减少关键需求猜测；不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:52-82","index.js:115-178"]}
{"unit_id":"1052326311__dsh-ask-first#card-en","repo":"1052326311/dsh-ask-first","commit":"7bcb928754969c1e107425b33c1e98480d686dbd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ask-first helps DSH agents clarify important requirements before substantive work. Configurable interview modes guide evidence checks and follow-up questions. A native dialog lets users approve or revise a brief, or continue discovery. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:52-82","index.js:115-178"]}
